{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20154","headline":"晓鹤 · 孟郊","name":"晓鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓鹤弹古舌，婆罗门叫音。\n应吹天上律，不使尘中寻。\n虚空梦皆断，歆唏安能禁。\n如开孤月口，似说明星心。\n既非人间韵，枉作人间禽。\n不如相将去，碧落窠巢深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}